  <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, the service is provided as is and as available, without warranties of uninterrupted operation, accuracy, or fitness for a particular purpose. We may change, suspend, or discontinue features. Keep any independent records you need for important arrangements.</p>
  <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, Vestris Inc. is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the service, interrupted availability, missed communications, or arrangements between users. Nothing in these terms excludes rights, remedies, or liabilities that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p>

  <h2>Ending Use and Changes</h2>
  <p>You may stop using Posebook and use its account-deactivation feature. Booking and audit records may remain as described in the Privacy Policy. For questions or requests about your account, contact <%= mail_to "drawing@dblock.org" %>.</p>
  <p>We may revise these terms. The date above identifies the latest version. We will provide any notice required by law, and continued use after updated terms take effect is subject to those terms. The applicable law may give you additional rights.</p>
